%% CrestFlow - Sequence Diagram: Onboarding and KYC (report level)
%% Type: UML sequence diagram
%% Rule: sign-in, wallet path, and KYC decision only.
sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Client as Browser and dApp
  participant API as REST API
  participant Identity as Auth and KYC
  participant Provider as Google and KYC vendor
  participant Wallet as Turnkey or user wallet

  User->>Client: sign in with Google
  Client->>API: authorization code
  API->>Identity: create session
  Identity-->>Client: JWT session

  alt Path A - embedded wallet
    Client->>API: provision wallet
    API->>Wallet: create embedded wallet
    Wallet-->>Client: wallet ready
  else Path B - external wallet
    Client->>API: link external wallet
    API->>Wallet: verify wallet signature
    Wallet-->>Client: wallet linked
  end

  Client->>API: submit KYC
  API->>Identity: start verification
  Identity->>Provider: check identity
  Provider-->>Identity: decision
  Identity-->>Client: KYC status and tier

  note over Wallet: Path A keeps keys<br/>in the Turnkey TEE
  note over Provider: KYC vendor is conditional<br/>on the two-week spike
  note over Identity: Only APPROVED passes<br/>policy check 1
